{"seq":3,"slug":"lastmile-fulfillment-carbon","title":"尾程配送碳排与合并派送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/lastmile-fulfillment-carbon","wordCount":1911,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"尾程配送碳排与合并派送\">尾程配送碳排与合并派送</h1><p>最后一公里是整个履约链路里单位排放最高的环节，原因不在于车辆效率低，而在于它的计量单位变了：干线运输按吨公里摊，尾程按<strong>单</strong>摊。一趟车送二十单和送八十单，燃料消耗大概只差两成，但分摊到每一单上，强度差了四倍。这就是为什么&quot;提高派送密度&quot;是尾程减排的第一杠杆，而它对碳足迹数字的影响远远超过更换电动车辆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>尾程排放有两种建模口径，选哪一种取决于你手上有什么数据：</p>\n<p><strong>按单均摊</strong>：先算整条派送线路（route）的总排放，再按单摊到每个订单上。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>parcel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>stop</mtext></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>travel</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>idle</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>facility</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>parcels</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{parcel}} = \\frac{\\sum_{\\text{stop}} E_{\\text{travel}} + E_{\\text{idle}} + E_{\\text{facility}}}{N_{\\text{parcels}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parcel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5479em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parcels</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">travel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">idle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">facility</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>按投递作业量</strong>：用车辆强度乘以实际投递距离，再按该订单的质量或体积加权。前者更适合&quot;共同配送、密度高&quot;的场景（一份货的碳排更接近&quot;占了一次派送机会&quot;），后者更适合&quot;专车专送、大件&quot;的场景。</p>\n<p>之所以必须把尾程单独建模，而不是并入干线运输，根本原因是它在整体排放里的权重被长期低估：全球范围内交通部门在 2016 年占全部二氧化碳排放的 21%（约 79 亿吨，总排放 367 亿吨），在 2018 年占能源相关二氧化碳排放的 24%（约 80 亿吨，总 335 亿吨）（<a href=\"https://ourworldindata.org/co2-emissions-from-transport\">Our World in Data 交通碳排放</a>）。这类占比数字说明运输是一个规模足够大、值得单独核算的排放源；而在运输内部，尾程正是因为按单摊、密度低，成为单位排放最高的那一段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[尾程派送线路] --&gt; B[行驶段排放]&#10;  A --&gt; C[怠速排放]&#10;  A --&gt; D[站点/驿站设施排放]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[距离 x 车型强度]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[载重修正]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[每站怠速时长]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[分拣与暂存能耗]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E[线路总排放]&#10;  B2 --&gt; E&#10;  C1 --&gt; E&#10;  D1 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{配送模式}&#10;  F --&gt;|门到门| G[按单均摊]&#10;  F --&gt;|自提点/驿站| H[按自提量均摊]&#10;  F --&gt;|合并派送| I[按合并后订单数均摊]&#10;  G --&gt; J[每单 kgCO2e]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J\">graph TD\n  A[尾程派送线路] --&gt; B[行驶段排放]\n  A --&gt; C[怠速排放]\n  A --&gt; D[站点/驿站设施排放]\n  B --&gt; B1[距离 x 车型强度]\n  B --&gt; B2[载重修正]\n  C --&gt; C1[每站怠速时长]\n  D --&gt; D1[分拣与暂存能耗]\n  B1 --&gt; E[线路总排放]\n  B2 --&gt; E\n  C1 --&gt; E\n  D1 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{配送模式}\n  F --&gt;|门到门| G[按单均摊]\n  F --&gt;|自提点/驿站| H[按自提量均摊]\n  F --&gt;|合并派送| I[按合并后订单数均摊]\n  G --&gt; J[每单 kgCO2e]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J</pre><p>怠速（idle）这一项常被忽略，但它是尾程特有的：城市配送车辆在每个停靠点熄火前往往空转几十秒到几分钟，一天几十个停靠点累积起来不可忽视。活动数据是&quot;停靠点数量 × 每站平均怠速时长&quot;，这个数据可以从派送 APP 的到站打卡时间戳里算出来——这是碳核算少有的能&quot;顺手&quot;从既有业务系统拿到高质量数据的场合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"派送密度-尾程最强的杠杆\">派送密度：尾程最强的杠杆</h2><h3 id=\"时窗-自提点-路径优化\">时窗、自提点、路径优化</h3><p>派送密度用<strong>每车每趟成功投递的包裹数</strong>衡量。它与每单排放的关系不是线性的：车辆行驶成本由路线长度与停靠点数量共同决定，但包裹数的增加主要增加停靠点的停靠时间，对行驶里程的边际影响有限。所以密度从 20 提升到 60，每单排放可能下降一半以上。</p>\n<p>密度的决定因素有三类，都属于产品或网络设计层面的决策：</p>\n<p><strong>投递时窗</strong>：把当日达改成次日达，可以让同一区域的订单攒到一起送。这是最直接的密度提升手段，代价是时效下降。跨境场景里&quot;当日达&quot;通常是靠前置海外仓实现的，而海外仓的备货本身又增加了仓储排放——这是一个真实的权衡，不是免费的减排。</p>\n<p><strong>自提点/驿站</strong>：把门到门改成集中投递到自提点，一趟车可以把几十上百个包裹卸在一个点位，密度直接跃升。派送端节省的排放需要与&quot;消费者额外前往自提点&quot;的排放做净额比较——如果消费者是开车专程去取，净效果可能为负。只有在消费者顺路或步行可达时，自提点才构成真正的减排。关于自提网络的组织，见 <a href=\"../../global-lastmile-delivery-network/\">125 全球尾程配送网络</a> 与 <a href=\"../../crowdsourced-elastic-lastmile/\">143 众包弹性尾程</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>路径优化与合并派送</strong>：把同一买家或同一地址的多个订单合并成一次投递。跨境场景里这个空间很大，因为买家经常同时下多个订单（不同 SKU、不同商家），而它们本来会被拆成多次派送。合并派送的技术难点不在算法，在订单同步：需要在下单环节就能识别&quot;同一收货地址在时间窗内还有别的在途订单&quot;。见 <a href=\"../../order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/\">134 订单智能拆单与多仓履约分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"车辆类型与电动化的真实效果\">车辆类型与电动化的真实效果</h2><h3 id=\"电动化的减排效果取决于电网\">电动化的减排效果取决于电网</h3><p>电动化对尾程的减排效果取决于电力因子，而不是&quot;是否电动&quot;这个事实本身。同一个电动面包车，在法国跑和在中国部分地区跑，每公里排放可以差好几倍。所以碳核算必须把车辆能耗（kWh/km）与区域电力因子相乘，而不是套用&quot;电动车零排放&quot;的直觉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>车辆类型</th>\n<th>能耗口径</th>\n<th>关键因子</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>柴油面包车</td>\n<td>L/100km</td>\n<td>柴油 WTW 因子</td>\n<td>目前城市配送主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电动面包车</td>\n<td>kWh/km</td>\n<td>区域电网因子</td>\n<td>城区、有充电条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电动三轮/四轮</td>\n<td>kWh/km</td>\n<td>区域电网因子</td>\n<td>高密度城区、短距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货运自行车</td>\n<td>人力为主</td>\n<td>近乎为零（含食品热量当量可忽略）</td>\n<td>超密集城区、小件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步行配送</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>楼宇内、园区内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自行车与步行在<strong>短距离、高密度</strong>的城区场景下是最优解，这个结论与直觉相反但对碳而言成立：它们不受拥堵影响、不需要停车位、装载量小但周转快。它们的适用边界是单件重量与体积——超出会显著降低可用性。</p>\n<p>需要提醒一个核算陷阱：<strong>不要把电动车的&quot;零尾气&quot;直接写成零排放</strong>。即使电网因子很低，电池制造阶段的隐含碳通常计入车辆生产而非运营，如果车辆是租赁的，这部分隐含碳是否计入取决于边界口径。若采用摇篮到坟墓且要求车辆制造隐含碳入账，租赁车辆的摊销规则必须在方法学文档里写清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现-线路级排放与订单级分摊\">实现：线路级排放与订单级分摊</h2><h3 id=\"加权分摊与等分的差额\">加权分摊与等分的差额</h3><p>尾程模型的实现要点是&quot;先算线路、再摊订单&quot;，并把线路参数完整留存以便复算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 线路级排放：一条派送路线一行&#10;CREATE TABLE lastmile_route_emission (&#10;  route_id          TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pcf_run_id        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  service_date      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  vehicle_class     TEXT NOT NULL,        -- diesel_van / ev_van / cargo_bike / walk&#10;  mode              TEXT NOT NULL,        -- door_to_door / pickup_point / locker&#10;  stops             INT NOT NULL,&#10;  distance_km       NUMERIC(10,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  idle_minutes      NUMERIC(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  parcels_delivered INT NOT NULL,&#10;  energy_per_km     NUMERIC(12,6) NOT NULL, -- L/km 或 kWh/km&#10;  energy_factor     NUMERIC(14,8) NOT NULL, -- kgCO2e/L 或 kgCO2e/kWh&#10;  idle_per_min      NUMERIC(14,8) NOT NULL,&#10;  route_kg_co2e     NUMERIC(18,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT density_ok CHECK (parcels_delivered &gt; 0 AND distance_km &gt; 0)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 订单级分摊：按质量加权，退化时按单等分&#10;CREATE VIEW lastmile_order_share AS&#10;SELECT p.order_id,&#10;       r.route_id,&#10;       r.route_kg_co2e,&#10;       p.package_kg,&#10;       SUM(p.package_kg) OVER (PARTITION BY r.route_id) AS route_kg_total,&#10;       CASE WHEN SUM(p.package_kg) OVER (PARTITION BY r.route_id) &gt; 0&#10;            THEN r.route_kg_co2e * p.package_kg&#10;                 / SUM(p.package_kg) OVER (PARTITION BY r.route_id)&#10;            ELSE r.route_kg_co2e / r.parcels_delivered&#10;       END AS order_kg_co2e,&#10;       r.route_kg_co2e / r.parcels_delivered AS order_kg_co2e_equal_split&#10;FROM lastmile_route_emission r&#10;JOIN parcel p ON p.route_id = r.route_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 线路级排放：一条派送路线一行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lastmile_route_emission</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  route_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pcf_run_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service_date      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vehicle_class     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- diesel_van / ev_van / cargo_bike / walk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- door_to_door / pickup_point / locker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stops             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distance_km       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idle_minutes      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parcels_delivered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  energy_per_km     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- L/km 或 kWh/km</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  energy_factor     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- kgCO2e/L 或 kgCO2e/kWh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idle_per_min      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  route_kg_co2e     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> density_ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (parcels_delivered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance_km </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 订单级分摊：按质量加权，退化时按单等分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lastmile_order_share</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_kg_co2e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route_kg_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_kg_co2e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package_kg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">package_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_kg_co2e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parcels_delivered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_kg_co2e,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_kg_co2e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parcels_delivered</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_kg_co2e_equal_split</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastmile_route_emission r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parcel p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">route_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同时输出加权分摊与等分分摊两个值是一个有意的设计：<strong>两者的差额就是&quot;密度收益被谁拿走&quot;的度量</strong>。当一个重货订单与一堆小件共乘时，质量加权会让重货承担更多，等分则让小件承担更多。选择哪一种要在方法学里声明，并保持全站一致——同一份报告里混用两种分摊方式是最容易被审计挑出的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>尾程的计量单位是&quot;单&quot;而不是&quot;吨公里&quot;，因此派送密度是最强杠杆；密度从 20 提到 60 可以砍掉一半以上每单排放。</li>\n<li>怠速排放来自停靠点空转，活动数据可以从派送 APP 的到站时间戳里直接取得。</li>\n<li>电动化的减排效果取决于区域电力因子，不要写成&quot;零排放&quot;。</li>\n<li>自提点减排成立的前提是消费者顺路，消费者专程开车前往时净效果可能为负。</li>\n<li>订单级分摊要么质量加权要么等分，必须全站统一并在方法学中声明。</li>\n<li>到这里履约段算完了。接下来把这套数字交付出去，见 <a href=\"../../carbon-label-disclosure/carbon-label-product-display\">商品碳标签与买家展示</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"尾程配送碳排与合并派送","id":"尾程配送碳排与合并派送"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"派送密度：尾程最强的杠杆","id":"派送密度-尾程最强的杠杆"},{"level":3,"text":"时窗、自提点、路径优化","id":"时窗-自提点-路径优化"},{"level":2,"text":"车辆类型与电动化的真实效果","id":"车辆类型与电动化的真实效果"},{"level":3,"text":"电动化的减排效果取决于电网","id":"电动化的减排效果取决于电网"},{"level":2,"text":"实现：线路级排放与订单级分摊","id":"实现-线路级排放与订单级分摊"},{"level":3,"text":"加权分摊与等分的差额","id":"加权分摊与等分的差额"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"仓储与包装环节碳排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/warehousing-packaging-carbon"},"next":{"title":"商品碳标签与买家展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/carbon-label-disclosure/carbon-label-product-display"}}